modern-ices Release Notes
=========================

0.2
---

This release builds on the initial 0.1 prerelease with user-facing playback,
logging, and documentation improvements.

Playback and streaming:

- Restored Icecast StreamTitle updates using source metadata, matching the
  behavior expected from ices 0.4.
- Read MP3 ID3 metadata, Ogg Vorbis comments, and FLAC Vorbis comments.
- Avoided reopening input files solely for metadata; metadata is now taken from
  the decoder or streaming path already being used for playback.
- Preserved the pkgsrc fixes for Vorbis comment parsing by matching complete
  `artist=` and `title=` keys instead of loose prefixes.
- Added `-r` / `--randomize` to shuffle playlist order once at startup, similar
  to the original ices playlist randomizer.
- Added optional log timestamps with `-s` / `--timestamp`, including custom
  `strftime` formats.

Documentation and packaging support:

- Added build dependency documentation for Debian-family systems and Fedora.
- Documented which libraries correspond to the `--with-*` configure options.
- Added a `modern-ices(1)` manual page.
- Added `--mandir` support and man page installation to the build system.

0.1
---

This was the first tagged prerelease of modern-ices.

Core functionality:

- Created a C++23 reimplementation of the streaming and transcoding core of
  ices 0.4.
- Added a simple configure script and GNU Make build.
- Streamed MP3 input directly to Icecast-compatible servers.
- Added transcoding support through libmpg123, libvorbisfile, libFLAC, and
  libmp3lame.
- Added MP3, Ogg Vorbis, and FLAC decoders for re-encoded playback.
- Added playlist-driven operation with `--once` support.
- Added crossfade support for transcoded playback.
- Reported library and runtime failures as clean errors instead of crashing.

Project process and attribution:

- Added source comments explaining the decoder and streaming structure.
- Documented the collaborative development process.
- Added credit for the original IceS/ices 0.x project and its source location.
- Added the `VERSION` file.
